{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-x-20w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn X 20W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn X 20W Pod System, featuring an integrated 850mAh battery, 5-20W output range, and is compatible with both G\/G2 Coils.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-x-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn X Replacement Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn X Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-coils\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn G Replacement Coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g2-replacement-coils\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn G2 Replacement Coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G2 Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Uwell Caliburn X Pod System\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/files\/Uwell_Caliburn_X_Pod_Systems_-_Infographic.jpg?v=1669764421\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable aluminum-alloy, the chassis of the Caliburn X Pod System offers a strong and resilient chassis against light falls and drops. Equipped with an 850mAh battery, the integrated battery delivers plenty of vapor throughout the day, allowing the Uwell Caliburn X to output 5-20W easily. In addition, the refillable pods hold up to 3mL, and utilizes a juice viewing window to ensure a minimum fill level to prevent any dry hits or burning of the coil.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Caliburn X 20W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 107.4mm by 27.5mm by 15.6mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery: Integrated 850mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Range: 5-20W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJuice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOLED Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 3mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn G\/G2 Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm Caliburn G2 Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntelligent Resistance Detection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Power Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e8s Vaping Overtime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn X\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn X Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm Caliburn G Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Caliburn G2 Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673630777399,"sku":"U Cali X Pod System","price":4700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_caliburn_x_-_pod_system_-_screen.png?v=1747872205","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-x-20w-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




